<title>SWITZERLAND: PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - March 24.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Switzerland - March 24.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here are the highlights from</p>
<p>Swiss newspapers on Monday:</p>
<p>NEUE ZUERCHER ZEITUNG</p>
<p>- Former Swiss National Bank president Fritz Leutwiler expressed reservations aganist the so-called Solidarity Fund, which will be stocked by gold reserves from the Swiss National Bank.</p>
<p>- Leading Swiss Christian Democratic politicians discussed at the weekend how Switzerland can find its way out of economic stagnation.</p>
<p>TAGES ANZEIGER</p>
<p>- Some 110,000 Swiss citizens have so far signed a petition calling for a public initiative to demand the free choice of medical doctors and hospitals.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
